				{
					"id": 411141503,
					"content": "莫娜真厲害。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141504
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411141504,
					"content": "當然了！派蒙，妳也覺得我很厲害對吧？對吧對吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141505,
					"content": "是啊是啊，沒有莫娜，我們恐怕會陷入更大的麻煩。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141506,
					"content": "哼，聽見沒有！愚人眾執行官！壞男人！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141507,
					"content": "不過看他剛才那麼震驚的樣子，也不像在撒謊。難道師父教導我占星術時所說的「虛假之天」還有其他含義？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141508,
					"content": "啊…咳咳，我走神了。那麼，去完成我們最重要的工作吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141509,
					"content": "<color=#00E1FFFF>隕石的核心</color>，一定就在這裡附近！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4111416,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4111416
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4111416",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4111416,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"莫娜"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 411141601,
					"content": "哇，這就是核心嗎，和其他隕石不太一樣呢！有種…明亮的感覺？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141602,
					"content": "這塊石頭上有著驚人的元素力和意念。確實是核心沒錯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141603,
					"content": "我們…應該破壞它嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141604
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411141604,
					"content": "嗯，不把它清理掉，人們就不會醒來……這塊核心就是一切事件的根源。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141605,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，加油啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141606,
					"content": "沒想到，原來是這麼一回事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141607,
						411141608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141607,
					"content": "攀爬的人，試圖抵達未知的高峰。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141609
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411141609,
					"content": "人類的信念，竟然可以在天空中留存千年…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141610,
					"content": "哎，果然占星學是個厲害的東西呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141611,
					"content": "為什麼突然說到這上面去了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141612,
					"content": "能和星星交流，就能掌握從古到今所有秘密，當然啦，能做到這種事的占星術士除了我也沒有幾個。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141613,
					"content": "莫娜，這次太謝謝妳了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141614
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411141614,
					"content": "幹、幹嘛啊，突然這麼認真…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141615,
					"content": "話說回來，那個叫菲謝爾的女孩子，還真是神奇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141616,
					"content": "我也覺得！她明明…呃…怎麼說呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141617,
						411141618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141617,
					"content": "是個充滿奇思妙想的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141619
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411141619,
					"content": "#雖然是這樣啦，但{F#妳}{M#你}回憶一下…她說的好像也沒錯呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141620,
					"content": "難道說，她就是那種用錯誤過程得出正確結果的人？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141621,
					"content": "說不定真是這樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141622,
					"content": "我最沒想到的是，尖帽子峰居然變成了一座小島！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141623,
					"content": "過去的高山成了海中一塊小小的陸地。現在的蒙德人只要坐上船，幾乎都能到那裡吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141624,
					"content": "那豈不是人人都能登上尖帽子峰了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141625,
					"content": "人人都能抵達山頂了呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141626
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411141626,
					"content": "萊納德會高興嗎？雖然尖帽子峰是個意外，但現在的蒙德人在風神幫助下已經能夠飛翔了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141627,
					"content": "有了翅膀，人就能去到更高更遠的地方，探索更多未知的角落。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141628
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141628,
					"content": "（萊納德，你的心願實現了嗎？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141629
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411141629,
					"content": "好了，處理完隕石核心，睡著的人一定會慢慢醒來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141630
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141630,
					"content": "我們也算是順利完成了冒險家協會的委託吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141631,
					"content": "嗯，希望大家…早日恢復。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 411141618,
					"content": "是個異想天開的怪人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141619
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411141608,
					"content": "執著的人，願將意志傳遞給未來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141609
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}